            {
                "entry_id": "c053792d-66de-3b87-be0b-29389aba2a32",
                "word": "numéraire",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a0be9a2b-b78c-43af-a0c1-f34307cb4a14",
                        "entry_id": "c053792d-66de-3b87-be0b-29389aba2a32",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "numéraires"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30434755-5f3c-3140-bf83-5f04f3bcfeaa",
                        "entry_id": "c053792d-66de-3b87-be0b-29389aba2a32",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Argent monnayé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Économie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d497ed5-a4ec-45bc-954e-04ce612609cc",
                                "sense_id": "30434755-5f3c-3140-bf83-5f04f3bcfeaa",
                                "text": "Plus ces prix sont assujettis à l'ordre naturel, & plus ils sont constamment hauts, […], plus aussi ils augmentent le numéraire de la Nation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30876c40-357f-4d6e-9b11-3af1b68eb115",
                                "sense_id": "30434755-5f3c-3140-bf83-5f04f3bcfeaa",
                                "text": "Dès la veille de la mobilisation; à Perros et à Trégastel, on ne trouvait plus de numéraire : la poste elle-même ne payait plus les mandats ; toutes les disponibilités avaient été épuisées par les retraits des caisses d’épargne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd15f38b-1ffe-4fd5-b8c3-e48ee5795976",
                                "sense_id": "30434755-5f3c-3140-bf83-5f04f3bcfeaa",
                                "text": "L’insuffisance du numéraire circulant en France étant avérée, Colbert avait résolu de protéger à outrance l'industrie du royaume."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "09c00c6e-6be5-34ea-ab9b-1a24a3264ce7",
                        "entry_id": "c053792d-66de-3b87-be0b-29389aba2a32",
                        "glosses": [
                            "En économie et finance mathématique, actif servant de référent pour les prix des autres actifs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Économie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24e15a3e-96c8-4501-b06a-16b0b313f904",
                                "sense_id": "09c00c6e-6be5-34ea-ab9b-1a24a3264ce7",
                                "text": "Mais à la différence d’autres monnaies électroniques de ce type, comme le Tether ou l’USDC, le produit de la vente de Terra n’a pas été placé dans des actifs sûrs, comme du numéraire (une devise comme le dollar par exemple) ou des obligations d’Etat, susceptibles d’être récupérés rapidement en cas de problème."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3214ddd2-d647-309a-a3db-187661c55a25",
                        "entry_id": "c053792d-66de-3b87-be0b-29389aba2a32",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Membre célibataire laïque d’une prélature, qui ne fait pas des vœux comme les religieux : pauvreté, chasteté et obéissance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2828933-f1ca-4578-b562-d7fecbba50c1",
                                "sense_id": "3214ddd2-d647-309a-a3db-187661c55a25",
                                "text": "Le soir, il rentre chez lui dans une des maisons de l’Opus Dei où il vit avec d’autres membres numéraires."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bcb8965-d322-4e1c-946c-a9bf24f9b214",
                                "sense_id": "3214ddd2-d647-309a-a3db-187661c55a25",
                                "text": "Les autres numéraires me montrèrent progressivement les exigences de la charité et de la justice, jointes aux enseignements de l’Eglise en matière sociale, dont saint Josémaria s’est tant de fois fait l’écho. Mais la directrice du centre me fit comprendre que c’était à moi de donner une réponse personnelle devant les problèmes de ma société."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35e77a1c-5e1d-4c73-8b7b-fcd90e772c3f",
                        "source_entry_id": "c053792d-66de-3b87-be0b-29389aba2a32",
                        "source_sense_description": "comptant, monnayé",
                        "target_lang_word": "currency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "currency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb12ba23-a7d3-3780-aa0b-b71e78764c34",
                                        "entry_id": "49d88236-a64e-3a82-b138-dea1092dee93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Money or other items used to facilitate transactions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "105e1bc9-baf5-477a-aabc-9413a6032d29",
                                                "sense_id": "cb12ba23-a7d3-3780-aa0b-b71e78764c34",
                                                "text": "Wampum was used as a currency by Amerindians."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ad4a4c6-0f11-44d9-812b-1e4c0d472ac3",
                                                "sense_id": "cb12ba23-a7d3-3780-aa0b-b71e78764c34",
                                                "text": "Money managers who play down currencies tend to argue that outguessing foreign exchange markets in the short term is perilous, and that, over the long haul, shifts in currency values tend to offset one another."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d09419a-49ba-3e21-999c-bdc43d5724e1",
                                        "entry_id": "49d88236-a64e-3a82-b138-dea1092dee93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Paper money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce552da-9216-410d-beee-6b58012f37e5",
                                                "sense_id": "6d09419a-49ba-3e21-999c-bdc43d5724e1",
                                                "text": "Spangler went through his pockets, coming out with a handful of small coins, one piece of currency and a hard-boiled egg."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d9c4286-2c27-48f1-a2c0-74c990639bb4",
                                                "sense_id": "6d09419a-49ba-3e21-999c-bdc43d5724e1",
                                                "text": "Two years on, and while the Sultan of Slowjamastan has instigated more than a few bizarre laws (he’s outlawed the wearing of Crocs, for example), the Republic also has all the trappings of a fledgling nation-state. It issues its own passports, flies its own flag, prints its own currency (“the duble”), and has a national anthem that’s played on state occasions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "841e5cfc-c4ae-3673-a9f0-ee1fd6718792",
                                        "entry_id": "49d88236-a64e-3a82-b138-dea1092dee93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being current; general acceptance, recognition or use."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5aa1ed1-fc0c-4fee-9a57-0b35bfaa7d40",
                                                "sense_id": "841e5cfc-c4ae-3673-a9f0-ee1fd6718792",
                                                "text": "The jargon’s currency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "955d5ca3-c063-4a1e-ac3e-6f47887ea435",
                                                "sense_id": "841e5cfc-c4ae-3673-a9f0-ee1fd6718792",
                                                "text": "Fear of punishment has no currency with me as long as I remain convinced of the larger value of what I have done."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2243315-05a7-34c3-aef8-9d3d3c245bc2",
                                        "entry_id": "49d88236-a64e-3a82-b138-dea1092dee93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Current value; general estimation; the rate at which anything is generally valued."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d33f0b2-af87-4eb3-a303-94bdfdc131a0",
                                                "sense_id": "e2243315-05a7-34c3-aef8-9d3d3c245bc2",
                                                "text": "He […] takes greatness of kingdoms according to their bulk and currency, and not after intrinsic value."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8038cd72-fc78-43a8-9a29-9150b0882824",
                                                "sense_id": "e2243315-05a7-34c3-aef8-9d3d3c245bc2",
                                                "text": "The bare name of Englishman […] too often gave a transient currency to the worthless and ungrateful."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f565740f-f130-3b26-8f28-e9035255cfd3",
                                        "entry_id": "49d88236-a64e-3a82-b138-dea1092dee93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fluency; readiness of utterance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
