                                                "example_id": "d399efa9-b235-461c-8480-cef69067029b",
                                                "sense_id": "6d2e7de0-75af-3df8-ac22-292cdabb1b95",
                                                "text": "Acting as the numéraire is one of the functions of money: to measure the worth of different goods and services relative to one another. \"Numéraire goods\" are goods with a fixed price of 1 used to facilitate calculations when only the relative prices are relevant ( Numeraire on Wikipedia.Wikipedia)"
